pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Output-frame paced, synchronized on game state, from a seed without a
# profile (fresh-2026-09-28, run with --fresh-profile): the new-player
# opening as fh1-opening-sync, then drive the Viper (throttle until it has
# moved), rewind (Y, the default layout's rewind button; the appdata seed's
# profile uses a layout where Y changes the camera), capture the rewinding
# camera and the rewind menu, resume from there (A) and capture the drive.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 100 1200 movie pressstart
capture 300 press-start
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
